  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "Given equation: 16 + 6 ÷ 18 - 5 × 1 = 14.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) 5 and 16\n\nGiven: 16 + 6 ÷ 18 - 5 × 1 = 14\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 5 + __**6 ÷ 18**__ - 16 × 1 = 14\n\n⇒ 5 + 0.33 - __**16 × 1**__ = 14\n\n⇒ __**5 + 0.33**__ - 16 = 14\n\n⇒ __5.33 - 16__ = 14\n\n⇒ - 10.67 ≠ 14\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) 14 and 18\n\nGiven: 16 + 6 ÷ 18 - 5 × 1 = 14\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 16 + __**6 ÷ 14**__ - 5 × 1 = 18\n\n⇒ 16 + 0.43 - __**5 × 1**__ = 18\n\n⇒ __**16 + 0.43**__ - 5 = 18\n\n⇒ __16.43 - 5__ = 18\n\n⇒ 11.43 ≠ 18\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) 5 and 14\n\nGiven: 16 + 6 ÷ 18 - 5 × 1 = 14\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 16 + __**6 ÷ 18**__ - 14 × 1 = 5\n\n⇒ 16 + 0.33 - __**14 × 1**__ = 5\n\n⇒ __**16 + 0.33**__ - 14 = 5\n\n⇒ __16.33 - 14__ = 5\n\n⇒ 2.33 ≠ 5\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 4) 18 and 6**\n\nGiven: 16 + 6 ÷ 18 - 5 × 1 = 14\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 16 + __**18 ÷ 6**__ - 5 × 1 = 14\n\n⇒ 16 + 3 - __**5 × 1**__ = 14\n\n⇒ __**16 + 3**__ - 5 = 14\n\n⇒ __19 - 5__ = 14\n\n**⇒ 14 = 14**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 4\".",
